  <item>
    <title>007.好东西！正在成为现实！！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677d3afd1962f0b7510bc016</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677d3afd1962f0b7510bc016</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jan 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《好东西》，适合所有被困住的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【划重点】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1 简单聊聊：好东西让我知道...</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> 旖 &nbsp;姐：原来工作和生活，我都做的很好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 小 &nbsp;文：就算我不完美，我也很好很好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a> Lily姐：哪怕没有百分之百实现自己所想，但我对自己是有交代的</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2 展开聊聊：好东西与我的生活...</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a> 好东西：是不是婚姻中男性的典型形象？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 再见爱人 ：觉醒的葛夕会离婚吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> Lily姐：我执着让自己开心这件事本身就挺值得开心的</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3 深入聊聊：谁能定义成功与失败呢？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1147">19:07</a> 旖姐：就算失败了，又能怎么样呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> Lily姐：瞄准月亮，哪怕失败，也在星辰之中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1441">24:01</a> Lily姐：看到自己小进步，使劲夸自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">26:43</a> 旖姐：实现目标的过程中，会觉得累吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 4 回到电影：好东西打动我的...</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a> 小文：我们没有在吵对方，而是在吵情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a> Lily姐/小文：《好东西》让我想到你，让我想到了一代又一代女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">39:42</a> 播客结尾：”去做“这两个字本身就很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownotes：小 文</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频剪辑：小 文</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：做自己的光，不需要太亮-孟宇</span></p>]]></description>
