  <item>
    <title>006.一事有恒，万事渐振</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674719ba11045e78e56d8ba2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674719ba11045e78e56d8ba2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Nov 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>运动带给我们的东西往往不止运动本身</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【划重点】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 0 本期概述</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> &nbsp;小 &nbsp;文：本期播客概述</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1 个人分享：运动于我而言......</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 群 &nbsp;姐：运动让我感觉自己无限可能 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 小 &nbsp;文：运动就是为了消遣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a> Lily姐：运动让我更欣赏自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> 旖 &nbsp;姐： 依靠这些方法瘦了20斤</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2 简单聊聊：运动让我了解到......</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a> Lily姐：学会寻找动机，用自驱力替代自制力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="632">10:32</a> 群 &nbsp;姐：关于跳绳的一些思考</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3 友情提示：运动推荐及注意事项</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 小 &nbsp;文：推荐运动T25&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="476">07:56</a> 群 &nbsp;姐：选择运动的注意事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> Lily姐：运动后补充肉蛋奶、按摩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> 小 &nbsp;文：推荐瑜伽博主Mady Morrison</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 4 一句话ENDING（给过去自己的鼓励）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1126">18:46</a> Lily姐：“你真NB”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1169">19:29</a> 小 &nbsp;文：“你已经做的很好了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">20:01</a> 群 &nbsp;姐：“还在坚持，继续努力”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">20:22</a> 旖 &nbsp;姐：“超越昨天的自己，就是超人”</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownotes：小 &nbsp;文</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频剪辑：小 &nbsp;文</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：超人-五月天</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢你能看到这里，祝你天天开心，我们下期见！</span></p>]]></description>
